/* IBIIIS 게임 화면 공용 스타일(전투 HUD·결과 팝업·미니맵 안내). 색·크기·글꼴은 여기서 바꾼다. 임시 디자인. */
.game-ui {
    -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Regular.otf");
    color: rgb(240, 240, 245);
    font-size: 22px;
    flex-grow: 1;
}
.panel {
    background-color: rgba(18, 22, 32, 0.78);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
}
.bold { -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Bold.otf"); }

/* 전투 HUD */
.hud { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px; }
.hud-top { flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }
.hud-bottom { flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; }
.stage-name { font-size: 28px; -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Bold.otf"); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.stats { flex-direction: row; }
.stat { margin-right: 18px; }
.evasion { align-items: center; }
.evasion-icon {
    width: 64px; height: 64px;
    background-color: rgba(90, 200, 255, 0.25);
    border-radius: 32px;
    -unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.evasion-icon.locked { -unity-background-image-tint-color: rgb(110, 110, 110); background-color: rgba(120, 120, 120, 0.25); }
.evasion-cooldown { font-size: 30px; -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Bold.otf"); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -unity-text-outline-width: 1px; -unity-text-outline-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); }
.evasion-caption { font-size: 16px; margin-top: 4px; }
.controls { font-size: 17px; white-space: normal; max-width: 900px; }
.hud-buttons { flex-direction: row; }
.hud-button {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-left: 10px; padding: 8px 14px;
    background-color: rgba(18, 22, 32, 0.85);
    color: rgb(240, 240, 245);
    border-radius: 8px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
}
.hud-button:hover { background-color: rgba(60, 80, 120, 0.9); }
.hud-button:active { background-color: rgba(90, 120, 170, 0.95); }
.hud-button:disabled { opacity: 0.4; }
.hud-button.on { border-color: rgb(255, 210, 90); color: rgb(255, 225, 140); }
.debug { position: absolute; left: 20px; bottom: 90px; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(170, 255, 170); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); padding: 4px 8px; }

/* 전투 말풍선: 꼬리 끝(아래 가운데)이 말하는 이의 머리 위 기준점에 온다. 플레이어 말풍선에는 .player가 붙는다. */
.bubble-layer { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; }
.speech-bubble {
    position: absolute;
    translate: -50% -100%;
    transform-origin: 50% 100%;
    margin-top: -12px;
    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
    border-radius: 14px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(40, 44, 56);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    align-items: center;
}
.speech-bubble.player { background-color: rgb(255, 246, 205); }
.speech-text { color: rgb(30, 32, 40); font-size: 22px; white-space: nowrap; -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Bold.otf"); }
.speech-tail {
    position: absolute; bottom: -9px; left: 50%;
    width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-left: -8px;
    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
    border-right-width: 2px; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(40, 44, 56);
    rotate: 45deg;
}
.speech-bubble.player .speech-tail { background-color: rgb(255, 246, 205); }

/* 미연시 대화창: 초상화는 대화 상자 뒤 좌우, 아래를 화면 하단에 맞춘다. 말하는 쪽 .speaking, 듣는 쪽 .listening */
.dialogue-overlay { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; }
.portrait {
    position: absolute; bottom: 0; width: 38%; height: 82%;
    background-size: contain;
    background-position-y: bottom;
    transition-property: -unity-background-image-tint-color, translate;
    transition-duration: 0.15s;
}
.portrait.left { left: 3%; background-position-x: left; }
.portrait.right { right: 3%; background-position-x: right; }
.portrait.listening { -unity-background-image-tint-color: rgb(110, 112, 125); translate: 0 12px; }
.portrait.speaking { -unity-background-image-tint-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); translate: 0 0; }
.dialogue-box {
    position: absolute; left: 6%; right: 6%; bottom: 28px; height: 210px;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    background-color: rgba(14, 18, 28, 0.9);
}
.dialogue-name { font-size: 26px; -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Bold.otf"); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.dialogue-text { font-size: 26px; white-space: normal; }
.dialogue-text.narration { -unity-font-style: italic; color: rgb(170, 175, 190); }
.dialogue-next { position: absolute; right: 24px; bottom: 14px; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(255, 220, 120); }

/* 결과 팝업 */
.popup-overlay { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.popup { width: 560px; align-items: center; padding: 28px 32px; }
.popup-title { font-size: 44px; -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/NotoSansKR-Bold.otf"); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.popup-title.won { color: rgb(255, 220, 110); }
.popup-title.lost { color: rgb(255, 130, 130); }
.popup-message { font-size: 22px; white-space: normal; -unity-text-align: middle-center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.popup-button { font-size: 22px; width: 200px; height: 52px; }

/* 미니맵 안내 */
.overworld { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; }
.overworld-hint { position: absolute; left: 20px; top: 20px; font-size: 18px; }
.prompt {
    position: absolute;
    translate: -50% 0;
    font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 230, 130);
    padding: 6px 12px;
}
